          "Applications for Public-Key Cryptosystems",
          "Requirements for Public-Key Cryptography",
          "The RSA Algorithm",
          "Description of the Algorithm",
          "Diffie–Hellman Key Exchange."
        ],
        "contactHours": 10,
        "textbookReferences": []
      },
      {
        "module": 4,
